      "subNo": null,
      "options": [],
      "figure": null,
      "wbImage": "https://minxue-app-oss.oss-cn-shanghai.aliyuncs.com/images/bf235b85-e5d4-4f50-9e42-af8330df9451/20260915/6949a6cf-d2b3-4740-bcb2-3a34220ed601.jpg",
      "answer": "6:3:4",
      "hasAnswer": true,
      "answerSource": "recognized",
      "answerSourceLabel": "卷面识别",
      "answerRisk": null,
      "analysis": "设三角形面积为S，则S = (1/2)a·h_a = (1/2)b·h_b = (1/2)c·h_c，因此a·h_a = b·h_b = c·h_c，得h_a : h_b : h_c = 1/a : 1/b : 1/c。代入a=2, b=4, c=3，得1/2 : 1/4 : 1/3。通分，最小公分母为12，化为6/12 : 3/12 : 4/12，即6:3:4。该比例已是最简整数比。所以，h_a:h_b:h_c = 6:3:4。"
    },
